<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL"
                  xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI"
                  xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC"
                  xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI"
                  xmlns:camunda="http://camunda.org/schema/1.0/bpmn"
                  id="Definitions_masterRuleList"
                  targetNamespace="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn">

  <bpmn:process id="masterRuleList" name="업무기준 목록조회" isExecutable="true">
    <bpmn:documentation>
masterRuleList — As-Is mui cmb/MasterRuleList (분석 §1 / 기능 §1 / BPMN §1) 의 To-Be BPMN.

사용자 결정 (2026-06-04 ~ 06-05):
  - DEC-02 cmb 그룹 camelCase (serviceId=screenId=masterRuleList) / pkg com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleList.*
  - DEC-03 영속성 = JPA (search=JPQL / save=rowStatus C·U + existsById 중복체크)
  - Q-009 RULE_ID != COALESCE(OLD_RULE_ID,'ZZZZ0000') 이력행 제외 As-Is 보존
  - Q-011 RULE_VER(업무버전) vs mcm-core VER(@Version) 별개 컬럼
  - delete 분기 부재 (As-Is 기존행 서버 삭제 없음 — USE_TP 논리삭제만)

2 action 매핑 (save 는 As-Is SaveMasterRule Java Wow Task 흡수 — Service.save() 단일 트랜잭션, OASIS process wrap):
  action=search → searchTask (masterRuleListService.search) — GetRuleMasterList (이력행/활성 필터 + 2 LIKE)
  action=save   → saveTask   (masterRuleListService.save)   — rowStatus C/U(INSERT 7 / UPDATE 3) + 중복PK 체크 + 자동 재조회 (As-Is save → Task_2)
    </bpmn:documentation>

    <bpmn:startEvent id="start">
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_to_gw</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_to_gw" sourceRef="start" targetRef="actionGateway" />

    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="actionGateway">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="input" value="action" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_to_gw</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_save</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>

    <!-- ───────────────────────── action=search ───────────────────────── -->
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search" name="search" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="searchTask" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="searchTask" name="업무기준 목록 조회 (이력행/활성 필터 + 2 LIKE)" camunda:class="masterRuleListService">
      <bpmn:documentation>
As-Is GetRuleMasterList (mui MasterRuleListMapper) 의 ANSI/JPQL 변환 (분석 §6.1).
- RuleMasterRepository.searchRuleMasterList(pRuleId, pRuleNm) — RULE_ID != COALESCE(OLD_RULE_ID,'ZZZZ0000') AND COALESCE(USE_TP,'N') != 'N'
- 동적 2조건: pRuleId / pRuleNm (UPPER 양변 contains LIKE)
- 반환 = { list: [rows...], cnt } (camelCase 12 컬럼, masterCategoryMng 정합)
      </bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="search" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleList.dto.MasterRuleListSearchRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search_end" sourceRef="searchTask" targetRef="endSearch" />
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endSearch">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>

    <!-- ───────────────────────── action=save (rowStatus C/U + 자동 재조회) ───────────────────────── -->
    <!--
      As-Is SaveMasterRule.java Java Wow Task 흡수 (분석 §7.2). master = ds_grdMain 변경행
      (rowStatus C/U). 가이드 §6-C-1: method parameter 이름 (master) == CactusRequest body grids.{key}
      와 일치 → 자동 binding. 단일 트랜잭션 (OASIS process wrap) — rows[] 원자성. save() 내부에서
      search() 재호출 = As-Is save → Task_2(Main조회) 자동 재조회.
    -->
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_save" name="save" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="saveTask" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="saveTask" name="업무기준 저장 (rowStatus C/U + 중복PK 체크 + 자동 재조회)" camunda:class="masterRuleListService">
      <bpmn:documentation>
INPUT: MasterRuleListSearchRequest { pRuleId, pRuleNm } + grids.master (List&lt;Map&gt;)
PROCESS:
  1. row.rowStatus="C" → existsById 중복체크(존재 시 DUPLICATE_DATA throw) → INSERT 7 컬럼
  2. row.rowStatus="U" → findById → UPDATE 3 컬럼 (RULE_NM/RULE_DESC/USE_TP)
  3. deleted 분기 부재 (As-Is 보존). RULE_ID 공란 → REQUIRED_VALUE
  4. McmAuditEntity AUDIT 자동 (C_*/U_*/VER). RULE_VER 업무버전 별개(공란→'1')
  5. 재조회 (As-Is Task_2 정합 — save() 내부 search() 재호출)
OUTPUT: Map { cnt_save, list: [...refreshed...], cnt }
      </bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="save" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleList.dto.MasterRuleListSearchRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_save</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_save_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_save_end" sourceRef="saveTask" targetRef="endSave" />
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endSave">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_save_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>

  </bpmn:process>

  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="BPMNDiagram_1">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="BPMNPlane_1" bpmnElement="masterRuleList">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="start_di" bpmnElement="start">
        <dc:Bounds x="152" y="172" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="actionGateway_di" bpmnElement="actionGateway" isMarkerVisible="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="245" y="165" width="50" height="50" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>

      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="searchTask_di" bpmnElement="searchTask">
        <dc:Bounds x="370" y="80" width="240" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="endSearch_di" bpmnElement="endSearch">
        <dc:Bounds x="672" y="102" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>

      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="saveTask_di" bpmnElement="saveTask">
        <dc:Bounds x="370" y="220" width="240" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="endSave_di" bpmnElement="endSave">
        <dc:Bounds x="672" y="242" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>

      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_to_gw_di" bpmnElement="flow_to_gw">
        <di:waypoint x="188" y="190" />
        <di:waypoint x="245" y="190" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_search_di" bpmnElement="flow_search">
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="165" />
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="120" />
        <di:waypoint x="370" y="120" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_search_end_di" bpmnElement="flow_search_end">
        <di:waypoint x="610" y="120" />
        <di:waypoint x="672" y="120" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_save_di" bpmnElement="flow_save">
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="215" />
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="260" />
        <di:waypoint x="370" y="260" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_save_end_di" bpmnElement="flow_save_end">
        <di:waypoint x="610" y="260" />
        <di:waypoint x="672" y="260" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
